.* QUIREGINF: WRKREGINF (the exit points), its option 5 DSPEXITPNT and
.* option 8 WRKEXITPGM (a point's programs) with its option 5
.* DSPEXITPGM. The registered column's values come centered from the
.* driver, as the golden shows them.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=POINTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FMTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=REGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NBRCL BASETYPE='ZONED 10 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPNAME CLASS=POINTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPFMT CLASS=FMTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPREGD CLASS=REGCL.
:VAR NAME=EPTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=EPREG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPDEREG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMAX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPCOUNT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPADDP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPADDL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPADDF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRMVP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRMVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRMVF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRTVP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRTVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPRTVF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPCHG CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMSGF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMSGL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EPMSGID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGMNBR CLASS=NBRCL.
:VAR NAME=PGM CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGMLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGTHDS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGMTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGCCSID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGDTALEN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PGDATA CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=PGTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=POINTS VARS='OPT EPNAME EPFMT EPREGD EPTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=PGMS VARS='OPT PGMNBR PGM PGMLIB'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=PGMKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKREGINF KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKREGH ENTER='RETURN 0'.Work with Registration Information
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=POINTS ACTLEN=1 SCROLL=YES.(No exit points found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 55'.5=Display exit point
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 58'.8=Work with exit programs
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit                Point
:LISTCOL VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit Point Format
:LISTCOL VAR=EPREGD USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=7.Registered
:LISTCOL VAR=EPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPEXITPNT KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPEPH TOPSEP=SYSNAM ENTER='RETURN 0'.Display Exit Point
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit point
:DATAI VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit point format
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=EPREG USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit point registered
:DATAI VAR=EPDEREG USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow deregister
:DATAI VAR=EPMAX USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum number of exit programs
:DATAI VAR=EPCOUNT USAGE=OUTPUT.Current number of exit programs
:DATAI VAR=EPADDP USAGE=OUTPUT.Preprocessing for add
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPADDL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPADDF USAGE=OUTPUT.Format
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPRMVP USAGE=OUTPUT.Preprocessing for remove
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPRMVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPRMVF USAGE=OUTPUT.Format
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPRTVP USAGE=OUTPUT.Preprocessing for retrieve
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPRTVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPRTVF USAGE=OUTPUT.Format
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPCHG USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow change
:DATAI VAR=EPMSGF USAGE=OUTPUT.Description message file
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=EPMSGL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI VAR=EPMSGID USAGE=OUTPUT.Message ID
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=EPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text description
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKEXITPGM KEYL=PGMKEYS HELP=WRKPGMH ENTER='RETURN 0'.Work with Exit Programs
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit point
:DATAIX VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Format
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PGMS ACTLEN=2 SCROLL=YES.(No exit programs found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 61'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 64'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 65'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ENTER='RETURN 70'.10=Replace
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PGMNBR USAGE=OUTPUT MINWIDTH=17.Exit        Program      Number
:LISTCOL VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT MINWIDTH=13.Exit          Program
:LISTCOL VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPEXITPGM KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPPGMH TOPSEP=SYSNAM ENTER='RETURN 0'.Display Exit Program
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=EPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit point
:DATAI VAR=EPFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit point format
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PGMNBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit program number
:DATAI VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit program
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=PGTHDS USAGE=OUTPUT.Threadsafe
:DATAI VAR=PGMTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Multithreaded job action
:DATAI VAR=PGCCSID USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit program data CCSID
:DATAI VAR=PGDTALEN USAGE=OUTPUT.Length of exit program data
:DATAI VAR=PGDATA USAGE=OUTPUT.Exit program data
:DATAI VAR=PGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text description
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKREGH.Work with Registration Information - Help
:P.The exit points the system calls programs at, one line for each
point and format. Type 5 to see how a point is set up, or 8 to see,
add and remove the programs registered on it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPEPH.Display Exit Point - Help
:P.How an exit point is set up: whether it may be deregistered and
changed, how many programs it takes and has, and the programs the
system names to check additions, removals and retrievals.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKPGMH.Work with Exit Programs - Help
:P.The programs called at one exit point, in the order of their
numbers. Type 1 to add one, 4 to remove one, 5 to see one, or 10 to
replace one, and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPGMH.Display Exit Program - Help
:P.One exit program: its number, its library, how a job with several
threads treats it, and the data handed to whoever calls it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F4 prompts the
command typed, F5 reads the programs again and F9 brings back the
last command.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
